    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_306 : answer(sorry) ↔ ∀ (q : ℚ), 0 < q → Squarefree q.den →\n    ∃ k : ℕ, ∃ (n : Fin (k + 1) → ℕ), n 0 = 1 ∧ StrictMono n ∧\n    (∀ i ∈ Finset.Icc 1 (Fin.last k), ω (n i) = 2 ∧ Ω (n i) = 2) ∧\n    q = ∑ i ∈ Finset.Icc 1 (Fin.last k), (1 : ℚ) / (n i)",
